    "title": "Virtual printer",
    "description": "Save the trees. Do not waste paper when setting up printing plates. Your phone or tablet can now replace the printer when preparing printed reports.\r\n\r\nApp emulated ipp printer. Anons it over mDNS as _ipp._tcp.local. Receives and responces on network request from other devices (e.g. PC). Also allowing use virtual printer from standart print service or apps working with printer directly.  You may use this app for debug.",
